{
  "id": "c1-e13-the-way-language-changes",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "The way language changes",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what do you find most challenging about communicating in English?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how do you think the way people communicate has changed?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you prefer to talk to people face to face or to write to them?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, which languages do you think are most useful to learn?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e13-a1",
            "c1-e13-a2",
            "c1-e13-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people communicating in different ways. Choose two of the pictures and say what the advantages of these ways of communicating might be, and what misunderstandings could occur.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these ways of communicating do you find the most effective?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e13-b1",
            "c1-e13-b2",
            "c1-e13-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people dealing with different languages. Choose two of the pictures and say what difficulties the people might face, and how they might overcome them.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, have you ever been in a situation like one of these?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some factors that cause a language to change, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10300
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e13-the-way-language-changes",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these factors influence the way a language develops?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7200
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e13-the-way-language-changes",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which has the greatest effect?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about language and communication.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it important for languages to follow strict grammatical rules?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think the dominance of English is a threat to other languages?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, does texting and instant messaging damage people's writing skills?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "How might translation technology change the need for people to learn foreign languages?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent can a person truly understand a culture without speaking its language?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should minority languages be taught in all schools?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e13-the-way-language-changes/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
